sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant H as Handler
    participant S as Store
    participant R as Redis
    C->>H: PUT /v1/stream/chat
    H->>H: authorize path · parse content type, TTL, fork headers, and body
    H->>S: handleCreate → Store.Create(path, opts)
    S->>R: HGETALL :meta · protocol error-precedence pre-check
    S->>R: EVALSHA create.lua
    Note over R: runs atomically — HGETALL → DEL → HSET → PEXPIRE
    R-->>S: reply CREATED
    S-->>H: meta, wasCreated = true
    H->>H: map typed result to status and response headers
    H-->>C: 201 · Location · Content-Type · Stream-Next-Offset 0_0
